    {
      "name": "dispute",
      "docs": [
        "Dispute / veto path. The `dispute_authority` overrides an attested",
        "outcome (set to INVALID, or to a different valid value) and CPIs into",
        "`sooth_market::settle`. Settle's parent-ix introspection accepts",
        "either `attest_outcome` or `dispute` as the legitimate parent. v1",
        "does NOT enforce a time window — dispute is callable any time before",
        "settle has run on this market."
      ],
      "discriminator": [216, 92, 128, 146, 202, 85, 135, 73],
      "accounts": [
